LAMMPS (29 Aug 2024 - Update 4)
clear
package gpu 1 neigh yes newton on split 1

units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p

read_data /tmp/accelnet-lammps-gpu/validation-h100/orthogonal.data
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (5.934 9.2969997 4.6489999)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
  reading atoms ...
  24 atoms
  read_data CPU = 0.001 seconds
replicate 10 10 10
Replication is creating a 10x10x10 = 1000 times larger system...
  orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (59.34 92.969997 46.489999)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
  24000 atoms
  replicate CPU = 0.001 seconds
pair_style accelnet/gpu direct /home/nagai/AccelNetGPU/AccelNetTrainer.jl/test/data/fortran_predict/Ti.nn.ascii /home/nagai/AccelNetGPU/AccelNetTrainer.jl/test/data/fortran_predict/O.nn.ascii
pair_coeff * *
neighbor 0.6 bin
neigh_modify every 10 delay 0 check yes
atom_modify sort 100 0.0
velocity all create 100 4928459 mom yes rot no dist gaussian
fix integrate all nve
timestep 0.0001
compute vir all pressure NULL virial
thermo 100
thermo_style custom step pe c_vir[1] c_vir[2] c_vir[3] c_vir[4] c_vir[5] c_vir[6]
thermo_modify format float %.17g lost error
run 20

